# Written by dev/bootstrap.sh — the tenant heimdall minted for this environment.
.env

# Agent scratch: settings, and worktrees that live inside the repo. A worktree here is
# a git repo of its own, so committing one is both easy and a mess to undo. Skills are the
# exception — they are the repo's own, so the contents are ignored rather than the directory,
# which is what lets a path back in.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
